{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"clsid2.mpc-hc","latestVersion":"2.8.4","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"MPC-HC is an extremely light-weight, open source media player for Windows. It supports all common video and audio file formats available for playback.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/clsid2/mpc-hc/blob/HEAD/COPYING.txt","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"MPC-HC is an extremely light-weight, open source media player for Windows. It supports all common video and audio file formats available for playback.","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/clsid2/mpc-hc/blob/HEAD/COPYING.txt","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Media Player Classic - Home Cinema (MPC-HC) is a free and open-source video and audio player for Windows. It is famous and loved for its simple and effective user interface, providing an excellent user experience. It offers a huge amount of functionality. Being a DirectShow player, it also allows flexibility and extensibility through third party filters.","moniker":"mpc-hc","name":"MPC-HC","packageUrl":"https://github.com/clsid2/mpc-hc","publisher":"MPC-HC Team","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/clsid2/mpc-hc","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/clsid2/mpc-hc/releases/tag/2.8.4","tags":["audio","cinema","fork","foss","media","media-player","music","open-source","player","video","video-player"]}},"longDescription":"Media Player Classic - Home Cinema (MPC-HC) is a free and open-source video and audio player for Windows. It is famous and loved for its simple and effective user interface, providing an excellent user experience. It offers a huge amount of functionality. Being a DirectShow player, it also allows flexibility and extensibility through third party filters.","moniker":"mpc-hc","name":"MPC-HC","packageUrl":"https://github.com/clsid2/mpc-hc","publisher":"MPC-HC Team","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/clsid2/mpc-hc","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/